<section id="calculators" class="section calculators"><article class="bmi panel"><p class="eyebrow">YOUR STARTING POINT</p><h2>Let’s look at your BMI.</h2><p>A simple screening tool to begin a bigger conversation.</p><form id="bmi"><div class="two"><label>Height <span>cm</span><input name="height" id="height" type="number" min="100" max="250" step="0.1" value="165" required></label><label>Weight <span>kg</span><input name="weight" id="weight" type="number" min="25" max="350" step="0.1" value="90" required></label></div><button class="button">Calculate my BMI</button></form><output id="bmi-result" aria-live="polite"><strong>33.1</strong> BMI</output><div class="scale"><i id="bmi-marker"></i></div><div class="scale-labels"><span>18.5</span><span>25</span><span>30</span><span>40+</span></div><p class="small">For adults aged 20+. BMI is a screening measure, not a diagnosis or treatment decision. A clinician can interpret it alongside your wider health.</p><a class="small" href="https://www.cdc.gov/bmi/adult-calculator/index.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener">About BMI ↗</a></article><article class="possibilities panel"><p class="eyebrow">YOUR NEXT CHAPTER STARTS HERE</p><h2>Imagine the possibilities.</h2><p>Explore what a change could look like for you.</p><div class="dial"><svg class="scale-face" viewbox="0 0 640 350" aria-hidden="true"><g id="scale-ticks"><line x1="61.6" y1="215.9" x2="102.0" y2="230.7" class="major"></line><line x1="78.9" y1="177.7" x2="98.2" y2="188.3" class="minor"></line><line x1="101.8" y1="142.6" x2="119.3" y2="156.0" class="minor"></line><line x1="129.8" y1="111.3" x2="145.0" y2="127.2" class="minor"></line><line x1="162.3" y1="84.7" x2="186.9" y2="120.0" class="major"></line><line x1="198.4" y1="63.4" x2="208.1" y2="83.1" class="minor"></line><line x1="237.3" y1="47.7" x2="243.9" y2="68.7" class="minor"></line><line x1="278.2" y1="38.2" x2="281.5" y2="59.9" class="minor"></line><line x1="320.0" y1="35.0" x2="320.0" y2="78.0" class="major"></line><line x1="361.8" y1="38.2" x2="358.5" y2="59.9" class="minor"></line><line x1="402.7" y1="47.7" x2="396.1" y2="68.7" class="minor"></line><line x1="441.6" y1="63.4" x2="431.9" y2="83.1" class="minor"></line><line x1="477.7" y1="84.7" x2="453.1" y2="120.0" class="major"></line><line x1="510.2" y1="111.3" x2="495.0" y2="127.2" class="minor"></line><line x1="538.2" y1="142.6" x2="520.7" y2="156.0" class="minor"></line><line x1="561.1" y1="177.7" x2="541.8" y2="188.3" class="minor"></line><line x1="578.4" y1="215.9" x2="538.0" y2="230.7" class="major"></line></g><path class="scale-pointer" d="M308 0h24l-12 19Z"></path></svg><div class="dial-reading"><span>YOUR ILLUSTRATIVE CHANGE</span><output id="change">−9<small>kg</small></output><span>of body weight</span></div></div><div class="slider-tray"><label for="starting">Your starting weight <output id="starting-value">90 kg</output></label><input id="starting" type="range" min="50" max="180" value="90"><div class="slider-ends"><span>50 kg</span><span>180 kg</span></div></div><fieldset><legend>Choose an illustrative change</legend><div class="percentages"><label><input type="radio" name="percent" value="5">5%</label><label><input type="radio" name="percent" value="10" checked>10%</label><label><input type="radio" name="percent" value="15">15%</label><label><input type="radio" name="percent" value="20">20%</label></div></fieldset><p id="goal" aria-live="polite">Illustrative weight: 81 kg at a 10% change</p><p class="small">An illustration, not a prediction or guaranteed result.</p></article></section>
